msgctxt "495\t635"
msgid "Looks like... I..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "649\t709"
msgid "Lost."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1085\t1145"
msgid "This is Katase."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160\t1220"
msgid "Uh-huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1230\t1347"
msgid "Sir? Are you hurt?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1348\t1381"
msgid "I'm fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1382\t1512"
msgid "Chairman, I've been so worried about⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1585\t1704"
msgid "You know... Katase."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1714\t1774"
msgid "You're the only one..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1796\t1911"
msgid ""
"I need your advice, sir.\\n"
"Please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1916\t2066"
msgid ""
"We've received an offer on the Dubai stock deal.\\n"
"10 times the original market value."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2067\t2275"
msgid ""
"Our European creditors have requested a meeting\\n"
"with you after hearing the news, and..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2278\t2398"
msgid "Money, huh? No surprise there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2441\t2560"
msgid "It's the only thing I have left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2575\t2748"
msgid "All this time, I've been vain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2755\t2895"
msgid ""
"Never relied on anyone.\\n"
"Never trusted anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2909\t2983"
msgid "Only the power of money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2996\t3107"
msgid "Chairman, this deal could bring you billions!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3140\t3229"
msgid "Please, you need to make a decision."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3270\t3435"
msgid ""
"But I suppose...\\n"
"people yearn to trust others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3463\t3537"
msgid "And to be trusted in return."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3556\t3640"
msgid "Maybe that's all anyone really needs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3673\t3763"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3780\t3949"
msgid ""
"Chairman! If we don't respond soon,\\n"
"who knows how they may respond!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3950\t4049"
msgid ""
"Please, sir! Answer me!\\n"
"Chairma⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4205\t4265"
msgid "Why is it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4297\t4404"
msgid "Why is it I feel so at peace?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4444\t4532"
msgid "Is this how it feels..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4572\t4641"
msgid "When your world comes crashing down?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4717\t4777"
msgid "Mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4783\t4890"
msgid ""
"As long as you live,\\n"
"you can always rebuild."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4938\t5016"
msgid "It's never too late to change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5842\t5895"
msgid "So they've come."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5896\t6022"
msgid ""
"What the...\\n"
"What are the CIA doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6030\t6120"
msgid "They're not CIA."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6121\t6181"
msgid "It's merely a cover."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6191\t6275"
msgid "They're all Black Monday leadership."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6344\t6446"
msgid "Then, that man is..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6452\t6512"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6533\t6603"
msgid "Andre Richardson."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6628\t6688"
msgid "So it's him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6698\t6885"
msgid ""
"That's right. He's the one who told me\\n"
"you were on your way here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6899\t7045"
msgid ""
"They knew everything the CIA\\n"
"and that fool Kazama were trying to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7059\t7209"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid your role in all of this\\n"
"has come to an end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7240\t7369"
msgid "Dammit. What are they gonna do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7438\t7611"
msgid ""
"Kill us and search for someone else\\n"
"who can get the military expansion bill passed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7656\t7716"
msgid "In other words..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7720\t7811"
msgid "I've outlived my usefulness to them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8030\t8163"
msgid ""
"Oh, there are plenty of people\\n"
"who could replace you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8164\t8218"
msgid "And unfortunately..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8219\t8416"
msgid ""
"You both know far too much\\n"
"for me to let either of you live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8464\t8524"
msgid "Die."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8605\t8665"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8924\t9007"
msgid "What the fuck!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9073\t9245"
msgid ""
"I'm not... ready to die yet!\\n"
"You hear me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9438\t9498"
msgid "Dammit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9615\t9675"
msgid "Daigo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9760\t9814"
msgid "Daigo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9815\t9869"
msgid "Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9870\t9932"
msgid "Are you hurt!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9947\t10071"
msgid "I... could ask you the same thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10072\t10186"
msgid "What... happened here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10340\t10400"
msgid "Mine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10417\t10613"
msgid ""
"Mine. What are you doing here?\\n"
"Are you hurt?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10703\t10891"
msgid ""
"That was a close one, huh?\\n"
"But... it's all okay now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10992\t11052"
msgid "Chairman..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11572\t11685"
msgid "Damn. He's tougher than I thought!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11735\t11945"
msgid ""
"I won't let it end like this.\\n"
"I'll kill you all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12254\t12384"
msgid "Die, god damn you! Die!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12676\t12747"
msgid "Stop! Stop!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12748\t12836"
msgid "Chairman. I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12837\t12988"
msgid ""
"Mine! You don't need to do this!\\n"
"You hear me!? Get back here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12989\t13148"
msgid ""
"Sorry, but the truth of it is...\\n"
"I don't deserve to live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13149\t13209"
msgid "Mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13222\t13282"
msgid "Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13304\t13401"
msgid "I might be a sorry excuse for a yakuza..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13402\t13526"
msgid "But I still know how to uphold my code of honor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13527\t13570"
msgid "Mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13571\t13678"
msgid "Stop it! Are you nuts!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13791\t14006"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san. I wish we could have met sooner.\\n"
"I really do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14035\t14095"
msgid "Mine...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14461\t14530"
msgid "Maybe in my next life..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14549\t14626"
msgid ""
"I'll have what it takes\\n"
"to earn your respect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14656\t14728"
msgid "No! Don't do this, Mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14729\t14789"
msgid "Mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15683\t15743"
msgid "Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15917\t15977"
msgid "Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15984\t16098"
msgid ""
"Tell me the truth.\\n"
"The traitor to the Tojo..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16151\t16247"
msgid "Was it Mine?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16304\t16414"
msgid "No. Not a chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "16458\t16614"
msgid "He... would never have betrayed you."
msgstr ""